# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository *and* in the working
# tree. Without this, Git for Windows checks files out with CRLF, and
# `prettier --check .` (endOfLine: "lf") fails on the Windows CI runners while
# passing on Linux. Binary assets (icons) must not be converted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
